Nirmala C Compiler
- Milestones:
-- local variables
-- if, while, for, &&, ||
-- function, parameter, recursive
-- global variables and literal strings
-- struct, union, enum, typedef
-- switch, goto, do, ++, +=, ?:
-- Array initializers
-- Preprocessors
-- unsigned, short, signed, size_t, static
-- struct initializer, nested, array of struct
-- pointer to function
-- optimizer
-- 'cc' driver
-- bootstrap

-Build:
run `make` to compile the compiler and driver
run `make clean` to clean the build artifacts
